    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.2.6.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ μετὰ τὴν ἀπόλυσιν εἰσὶν ὧδε ἐπίσκοποι καὶ Νεμεσῖνος ὧδέ ἐστιν. ἕκαστος ὑμῶν, καθὼς πιστεύει, ὑπογράψει.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1#pta0022.pta017.3.2.6.s3",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.2.6.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ Ἀθανάσιος ὧδέ ἐστιν· ὁ μὴ εἰδὼς τὸν τῆς πίστεως λόγον μάθῃ παρὰ Ἀθανασίου. ἔχετε τὴν αὔριον καὶ τὴν μεθαύριον. ἐκβαίνω γὰρ ἐγὼ εἰς κάμπον.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1#pta0022.pta017.3.3",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καί τις σχολαστικὸς τῶν κυνικῶν ἐνέτυχε τῷ βασιλεῖ· δέομαι τοῦ βασιλείου σου προφάσει Ἀθανασίου τοῦ ἐπισκόπου ὁ καθολικὸς τὰς οἰκίας μου ἦρεν.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1#pta0022.pta017.3.3.1",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.3.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὁ βασιλεὺς εἶπεν· εἰ ὁ καθολικὸς τὰς οἰκίας σου ἦρε, τί κοινὸν Ἀθανασίῳ;",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1#pta0022.pta017.3.3.2",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.3.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἕτερός τις σχολαστικὸς Παταλᾶς εἶπε· κατηγορίαν ἔχω κατὰ Ἀθανασίου.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1#pta0022.pta017.3.3.3",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0022/pta017/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0022.pta017.3.3.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὁ βασιλεὺς εἶπε· καὶ σύ, τί κοινὸν ἔχεις πρὸς Χριστιανοὺς Ἕλλην ὤν;",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 363,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
